{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZA0Q95JHRP1793264074.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日劇《別班》第二季近日被指辱華，與劇集推出聯乘商品的三麗鷗SANRIO，宣布終止合作並致歉。</p><p></p><p><strong>聯名玩偶穿間諜服裝</strong></p><p></p><p>三麗鷗SANRIO與日劇《別班》第二季，推出一系列HELLO KITTY、MELODY等聯乘產品，部分玩偶穿上劇中間諜角色的服裝。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SANRIO 1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Fa7jA01gcU1793253055.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這部劇集由日本TBS電視台製作，由堺雅人、阿部寬等主演。內地官媒日前批評，劇集將侵華日軍曾施加於中國人民的酷刑，嫁接到中方角色身上，編造虛假情節，渲染中國威脅，顛倒黑白。</p><p></p><p>《環球時報》周三晚發文，批評三麗鷗跟一齣帶有強烈對抗色彩的日劇合作。又指中國是三麗鷗至關重要的海外市場，認為既然重視中國市場，就應將尊重中國落實在行動上，在涉及歷史認知與對外立場上，三麗鷗絕不應陪著日本右翼玩火。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SANRIO 1300_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qOTeqvhzzP1793253081.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>三麗鷗微博致歉</strong></p><p></p><p>三麗鷗周三深夜在微博發聲明致歉，指今次聯名相關內容包含了與集團企業理想不符的表達，決定停止聯名及所有後續項目的宣傳活動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:25.358829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":384,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T05:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.761995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:24.375017+00:00","content_hash":"157f1ac2e3374da974fab01b78909185744a9e35351ea835bde0dfd4f53dc5bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:25.358829+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}